\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

\textbf{Total: 42 findings across 2 assessment rounds.}

\subsection{Remediation Summary}
\begin{itemize}[nosep]
  \item \textbf{Round 1 (April 5):} 27 findings identified; 21 remediated immediately
  \item \textbf{Round 2 (April 6):} 15 additional findings via forensic re-audit; 11 remediated
  \item \textbf{Overall:} 32 FIXED, 2 MITIGATED, 2 NOTED, 6 ACCEPTED with documented risk rationale
  \item \textbf{Dependency CVEs:} 14 Python CVEs resolved, 1 npm CVE resolved, 1 npm dev-only accepted
\end{itemize}

All Critical and High severity findings that were fixable without infrastructure changes have been resolved.

